			cf. R<i><span class="en">ib. Com. p. 89
			sq.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The Maker of the world</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Valent. 24</span></i>. 
